    "title": "Westlake homeowners may see insurance discounts after improved fire rating - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Devin Cruice ,\n4 hours ago WESTLAKE, La. — Some homeowners in Westlake might see discounts on their insurance after the city earned an improved fire rating. The city of Westlake now has a Class 2 fire rating, improving from a Class 3. Fire Chief Jonathan Duff said the rating is based on how a fire district can fight fires. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
